Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.04,0:21:04.36,Layzner,Com,0,0,0,,目前的状况无法攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.47,0:21:07.39,Layzner,Eiji,0,0,0,,我知道 那些等一下再想吧 动力全开
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.98,0:21:16.52,Layzner,Gail,0,0,0,,开枪 把它打下来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.06,0:21:27.30,Layzner,Com,0,0,0,,离接触时间还有2秒 离脱离火星还有18秒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.66,0:21:34.30,Layzner,Gail,0,0,0,,开枪 不要让他离开火星
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.30,0:21:36.21,Layzner,Com,0,0,0,,离脱离火星还有09秒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.31,0:21:38.21,Layzner,Com,0,0,0,,07...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.59,0:21:40.52,Layzner,Com,0,0,0,,05...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.40,0:21:44.75,Layzner,Gail,0,0,0,,开火
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.54,0:22:01.39,Layzner,Gail,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.18,0:22:06.62,Layzner,Eiji,0,0,0,,干扰粒子散布
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.62,0:22:07.32,Layzner,Com,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.44,0:22:21.28,Layzner,Egyle,0,0,0,,中尉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.28,0:22:23.91,Layzner,Gail,0,0,0,,全员朝母舰前进 追击母舰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.92,0:22:31.41,Layzner,Anna,0,0,0,,再见了 红色之星
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.88,0:22:36.89,Layzner,Anna,0,0,0,,但是却没有人想说 这样就能回地球了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:45.23,Layzner,Anna,0,0,0,,也有可能是再次把我们打入绝望的深渊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:45.23,Layzner,Anna,0,0,0,,在我们眼前出现的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.41,0:22:47.95,Layzner,Anna,0,0,0,,那才是最可怕的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.07,0:23:56.11,Layzner,,0,0,0,,被耍了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.79,0:23:59.41,Layzner,,0,0,0,,军人的脑子真是用石头做的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.41,0:24:01.51,Layzner,,0,0,0,,快回答我们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.38,0:24:01.51,Layzner,,0,0,0,,英二
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.51,0:24:03.41,Layzner,,0,0,0,,大家 地球就拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.99,0:24:09.50,Layzner,,0,0,0,,下一话 空虚的宇宙
